---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="MBR City Events"
  description="District-wide events across MBR City — Meydan racing, District One's lagoon calendar, and what genuinely draws people from across the district."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Events</p>
    <h1>What's on, district-wide</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This page covers what draws people from across MBR City's
      communities, not what's hyper-local to just one of them. For
      Riviera's own hyper-local calendar, see
      <a href="https://riviera.dst.llc/events/">its dedicated page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>What counts as district-wide here</h2>
    <p>
      Meydan Racecourse events — most notably the Dubai World Cup — draw
      attention and traffic across the whole district, not just Meydan
      residents. District One's Crystal Lagoon hosts its own seasonal
      programming that pulls from neighbouring communities too. Citywide
      festivals get plenty of coverage elsewhere; this page deliberately
      doesn't duplicate that.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: var(--space-5); }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 65ch; }
</style>
